2. ‑‑or‑‑ `LOWER(tn.element)` / `LOWER(sn.element)` IN the same list after UNNEST() of `tradeNames`/`synonyms`.  
3. `m.blackBoxWarning = TRUE`  
4. `m.isApproved      = TRUE`  
